## Test Scenarios

### Upload & Processing

| # | Scenario | Expected | Result | Notes |
|---|----------|----------|--------|-------|
| 1 | Upload valid text-based PDF | Processes successfully, sidebar shows doc card | PASS | |
| 2 | Upload same PDF twice | "Already loaded" info message, no re-embedding | PASS | |
| 3 | Upload password-protected PDF | st.error with clear message | PASS | |
| 4 | Upload scanned PDF (image-only) | st.warning about scanned document | PASS | |
| 5 | Upload multiple PDFs at once | All processed, all appear in sidebar | PASS | |

### Query & Answer

| # | Scenario | Expected | Result | Notes |
|---|----------|----------|--------|-------|
| 6 | Submit blank query | st.warning "Please enter a question" | PASS | |
| 7 | Submit query under 5 chars | st.warning about too short | PASS | |
| 8 | Submit query over 500 chars | st.warning about too long | PASS | |
| 9 | Ask question covered in document | Accurate answer with citation | PASS | |
| 10 | Ask question NOT in document | "No relevant passages found" message | PASS | |
| 11 | Ask follow-up referencing previous answer | Correct context-aware response | PASS | |
| 12 | Submit query before uploading any PDF | st.warning to upload first | PASS | |

