## Bugs Found & Fixed

| # | Bug | Impact | Fix Applied |
|---|-----|--------|-------------|
| 1 | `upload_docs` typo in session state | App crash on upload | Renamed to `uploaded_docs` |
| 2 | Trailing comma on metadata assignment | doc_name stored as tuple | Removed trailing commas |
| 3 | `all_documents.extend` inside metadata loop | Docs added N×N times | Moved outside inner loop |
| 4 | Chain build inside per-file for loop | Index rebuilt per file | Moved outside for loop |
| 5 | `uploaded_docs.append` outside for loop | Only last file registered | Moved inside for loop |
| 6 | `doc_chunk_counts` not in session state | AttributeError on sidebar render | Added to defaults |
| 7 | `doc_count` used before defined | NameError in chat loop | Defined before loop |
| 8 | `usage_metadat` typo | Token count always None | Fixed to `usage_metadata` |
| 9 | `Document` object not subscriptable | Chain crash on invoke | Added recursive flatten in RerankRetriever |
| 10 | Variable `scores` shadowed in reranker loop | Subtle scoring bug | Renamed loop var to `score` |
| 11 | Chat history rendered below input | New answers appeared at bottom | Moved history block above input |

---

## Environment

- **Python:** 3.12  
- **Streamlit:** check with `streamlit --version`  
- **LangChain:** langchain-classic  
- **Embedding model:** gemini-embedding-2-preview  
- **LLM:** gemini-2.5-flash-lite  
- **Reranker:** cross-encoder/ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2  
- **Vector store:** ChromaDB  
- **Test document:** Contract.pdf